{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22508","headline":"放旅雁 · 白居易","name":"放旅雁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九江十年冬大雪，江水生冰树枝折。\n百鸟无食东西飞，中有旅鴈声最饥。\n雪中啄草冰上宿，翅冷腾空飞动迟。\n江童持网捕将去，手携入市生卖之。\n我本北人今谴谪，人鸟虽殊同是客。\n见此客鸟伤客人，赎汝放汝飞入云。\n鴈鴈汝飞向何处？第一莫飞西北去。\n淮西有贼讨未平，百万甲兵久屯聚。\n官军贼军相守老，食尽兵穷将及汝。\n健儿饥饿射汝吃，拔汝翅翎爲箭羽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22508.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22508","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}